    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The value for this key is an instance of [`NSDictionary`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSDictionary).",
      "ko": "The system updates this value only after the [`status`](avexperiencecontroller/transitioncontext/status-swift.property.md) changes to [`AVExperienceController.TransitionContext.Status.finished(result:)`](avexperiencecontroller/transitioncontext/status-swift.enum/finished(result:).md).",
      "sourceHash": "5c4aa14564a40f76a831998bf01b439f18b5bfe5dacde852d738e79cf25d7151",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Add entries to this dictionary to manually change bit rate, B-frame delivery, I-frame interval, and codec quality.",
      "ko": "이 딕셔너리에 항목을 추가해 비트 전송률, B-frame 전달, I-frame 간격, 코덱 품질을 수동으로 변경할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9f0b5d572bc8798e3cff2e8896e3e728366eb3a8035165a172885044ee7c6bf9",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Querying the [`supportedOutputSettingsKeys(for:)`](avcapturemoviefileoutput/supportedoutputsettingskeys(for:).md) method reveals the keys supported for the current release and configuration.",
      "ko": "현재 릴리스 및 구성에서 지원되는 키는 [`supportedOutputSettingsKeys(for:)`](avcapturemoviefileoutput/supportedoutputsettingskeys(for:).md) 메서드를 조회하면 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2eebcc9e1c1f69e51113911253b55a39c935ca71e44eaff856b41c505e060105",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
